# Output File Links

When generating or referencing any file (reports, logs, HTML, scripts, etc.), always show the **full absolute path** as a clickable markdown link:

```
[filename.html](file:///Users/robertjones/Documents/PD/CAN/CANLogger/logs/filename.html)
```

- Never show a relative path alone
- Always use `file://` URI so the user can click to open directly in the browser
- Apply to: HTML reports, log files, any generated output
